                    <h3 class="h5 workflow-card-title mb-2" data-i18n="services_page.step2_title">Desarrollo Iterativo</h3>
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-0" data-i18n="services_page.step2_desc">
                        Avanzamos en sprints ágiles con entregables funcionales, revisiones de código exhaustivas y comunicación continua.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Paso 3 -->
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                <div class="workflow-card p-4 rounded-4 h-100 border">
                    <div class="workflow-step-badge mb-3">03</div>
                    <h3 class="h5 workflow-card-title mb-2" data-i18n="services_page.step3_title">QA & Seguridad CI/CD</h3>
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-0" data-i18n="services_page.step3_desc">
                        Pruebas unitarias, de integración y escaneo de vulnerabilidades integrados en cada despliegue automatizado.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Paso 4 -->
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                <div class="workflow-card p-4 rounded-4 h-100 border">
                    <div class="workflow-step-badge mb-3">04</div>
                    <h3 class="h5 workflow-card-title mb-2" data-i18n="services_page.step4_title">Despliegue & Soporte</h3>
                    <p class="text-muted small mb-0" data-i18n="services_page.step4_desc">
                        Pase a producción sin tiempo de inactividad, monitoreo continuo del rendimiento y soporte proactivo post-lanzamiento.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- =========================================================================
     4. FORMULARIO DE CONSULTORÍA & CONTACTO
     ========================================================================= -->
<section class="services-form-section py-5 py-lg-6 bg-light" id="formulario-contacto" aria-labelledby="services-form-title">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="services-form-container cta-banner rounded-4 p-4 p-lg-5 text-white shadow-lg position-relative overflow-hidden">
            <div class="cta-bg-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            
            <div class="position-relative z-1">
                <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
                    <!-- Columna Izquierda: Propuesta de valor & contacto directo -->
                    <div class="col-12 col-lg-5">
                        <h2 id="services-form-title" class="h1 fw-bold mb-3 text-white" data-i18n="services_page.form_title">
                            ¿Tienes un proyecto desafiante en mente?
                        </h2>
                        
                        <p class="text-white-50 mb-4 lead fs-6" data-i18n="services_page.form_subtitle">
                            Conversemos sobre tus metas tecnológicas y diseñemos juntos una arquitectura sólida, escalable y optimizada para tu negocio.
                        </p>

                        <div class="form-benefits-list mb-4">
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                                <div class="form-check-icon">
                                    <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
                                </div>
                                <span class="text-white-90 small" data-i18n="services_page.form_feat1">Respuesta técnica en menos de 24 horas</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3">
                                <div class="form-check-icon">
                                    <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
                                </div>
                                <span class="text-white-90 small" data-i18n="services_page.form_feat2">Acuerdo de confidencialidad (NDA) garantizado</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                                <div class="form-check-icon">
                                    <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
                                </div>
                                <span class="text-white-90 small" data-i18n="services_page.form_feat3">Diagnóstico preliminar sin costo ni compromiso</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="pt-3 border-top border-white-15">
                            <p class="text-white-50 extra-small mb-2" data-i18n="services_page.form_whatsapp_alt">¿Prefieres una consulta inmediata?</p>
                            <a href="https://wa.me/51987654321?text=Hola%20SoftCore,%20deseo%20asesoría%20sobre%20un%20proyecto%20de%20software" 
                               target="_blank" 
                               rel="noopener noreferrer" 
                               class="btn btn-hero-outline-light rounded-pill px-4 py-2 d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <path d="M12.031 6.172c-3.181 0-5.767 2.586-5.768 5.766-.001 1.298.38 2.27 1.019 3.287l-.582 2.128 2.182-.573c.978.58 1.911.928 3.145.929 3.178 0 5.767-2.587 5.768-5.766.001-3.187-2.575-5.77-5.764-5.771zm3.392 8.244c-.144.405-.837.774-1.17.824-.299.045-.677.063-1.092-.069-.252-.08-.575-.187-.988-.365-1.739-.751-2.874-2.502-2.961-2.617-.087-.116-.708-.94-.708-1.793s.448-1.273.607-1.446c.159-.173.346-.217.462-.217l.332.006c.106.005.249-.04.39.298.144.347.491 1.2.534 1.287.043.087.072.188.014.304-.058.116-.087.188-.173.289l-.26.304c-.087.086-.177.18-.076.354.101.174.449.741.964 1.201.662.591 1.221.774 1.394.86s.275.072.376-.043c.101-.116.433-.506.549-.68.116-.173.231-.145.39-.087s1.011.477 1.184.564.289.13.332.202c.043.073.043.419-.101.824z"/>
                                </svg>
                                <span data-i18n="services_page.form_btn_whatsapp">Escribir por WhatsApp</span>
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
                                </svg>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Columna Derecha: Tarjeta con Formulario de Contacto -->
                    <div class="col-12 col-lg-7">
                        <div class="services-form-card bg-white text-dark rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5 shadow">
                            <h3 class="h4 fw-bold mb-1 text-navy" data-i18n="services_page.form_card_title">
                                Solicitar Asesoría Técnica
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-muted small mb-4" data-i18n="services_page.form_card_subtitle">
                                Completa el formulario y analizaremos tus requerimientos sin costo inicial.
                            </p>

                            <!-- Notificaciones de éxito o error dentro de la tarjeta del formulario -->
                            {% for message in app.flashes('success') %}
                                <div class="alert alert-success alert-auto-dismiss fade show rounded-3 mb-4 shadow-sm border-0 d-flex align-items-center gap-2" role="alert">
                                    <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-success flex-shrink-0">
                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                                    </svg>
                                    <div class="fw-semibold small">{{ message }}</div>
                                </div>
                            {% endfor %}
                            {% for message in app.flashes('error') %}
                                <div class="alert alert-danger alert-auto-dismiss fade show rounded-3 mb-4 shadow-sm border-0 d-flex align-items-center gap-2" role="alert">
                                    <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" class="text-danger flex-shrink-0">
                                        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                                    </svg>
                                    <div class="fw-semibold small">{{ message }}</div>
                                </div>
                            {% endfor %}

                            <form action="{{ path('app_services') }}" method="POST" id="servicesInquiryForm" class="needs-validation" novalidate>
                                <div class="row g-3">
                                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                                        <label for="contact_name" class="form-label small fw-semibold text-secondary" data-i18n="services_page.form_lbl_name">
                                            Nombre Completo <span class="text-danger">*</span>
                                        </label>
                                        <input type="text" 
                                               class="form-control rounded-3" 
                                               id="contact_name" 
                                               name="name" 
                                               required 
                                               placeholder="Ej. Carlos Torres" 
                                               data-i18n-ph="services_page.form_ph_name">
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                                        <label for="contact_email" class="form-label small fw-semibold text-secondary" data-i18n="services_page.form_lbl_email">
                                            Correo Corporativo <span class="text-danger">*</span>
                                        </label>
                                        <input type="email" 
                                               class="form-control rounded-3" 
                                               id="contact_email" 
                                               name="email" 
                                               required 
                                               placeholder="nombre@empresa.com" 
                                               data-i18n-ph="services_page.form_ph_email">
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                                        <label for="contact_company" class="form-label small fw-semibold text-secondary" data-i18n="services_page.form_lbl_company">
                                            Empresa / Organización
                                        </label>
                                        <input type="text" 
                                               class="form-control rounded-3" 
                                               id="contact_company" 
                                               name="company" 
                                               placeholder="Tu empresa o startup" 
                                               data-i18n-ph="services_page.form_ph_company">
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                                        <label for="contact_service" class="form-label small fw-semibold text-secondary" data-i18n="services_page.form_lbl_service">
                                            Servicio de Interés <span class="text-danger">*</span>
                                        </label>
                                        <select class="form-select rounded-3" id="contact_service" name="service" required>
                                            <option value="" selected disabled data-i18n="services_page.form_opt_select">Selecciona una opción...</option>
                                            <option value="software" data-i18n="services_page.form_opt_1">Software a Medida & APIs</option>
                                            <option value="cloud" data-i18n="services_page.form_opt_2">Cloud Architecture & DevOps</option>
                                            <option value="web-mobile" data-i18n="services_page.form_opt_3">Aplicaciones Web & Móviles</option>
                                            <option value="consultoria-it" data-i18n="services_page.form_opt_4">Consultoría & Auditoría IT</option>
                                            <option value="databases" data-i18n="services_page.form_opt_5">Bases de Datos & Rendimiento</option>
                                            <option value="seguridad" data-i18n="services_page.form_opt_6">Ciberseguridad & Hardening</option>
                                            <option value="otro" data-i18n="services_page.form_opt_other">Otro requerimiento</option>
                                        </select>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="col-12">
                                        <label for="contact_message" class="form-label small fw-semibold text-secondary" data-i18n="services_page.form_lbl_message">
                                            Cuéntanos sobre tu proyecto <span class="text-danger">*</span>
                                        </label>
                                        <textarea class="form-control rounded-3" 
                                                  id="contact_message" 
                                                  name="message" 
                                                  rows="3" 
                                                  required 
                                                  placeholder="Describe brevemente tus requerimientos técnicos, metas o plazos estimados..." 
                                                  data-i18n-ph="services_page.form_ph_message"></textarea>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="col-12 mt-4 text-center">
                                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-submit-service rounded-pill px-4 py-2 d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-2">
                                            <span data-i18n="services_page.form_btn_submit">Enviar Solicitud de Asesoría</span>
                                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"/>
                                            </svg>
                                        </button>
                                    </div>

                                    <div class="col-12 text-center mt-2">
                                        <span class="text-muted extra-small d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-1">
                                            <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/></svg>
                                            <span data-i18n="services_page.form_privacy">Tus datos están protegidos. Confidencialidad técnica garantizada.</span>
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </form>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
{% endblock %}
